      "id": "table_export_format",
      "theme": "runtime_validators_evals",
      "invariant": "Every table a run exports is in the economics/management three-line (三线表) form the target journals print: a heavy top rule, a light header rule and a heavy closing rule in the .docx with no vertical or stray interior rules and no borders inherited implicitly from a Word table style, booktabs rather than \\hline in the paired .tex, and any opt-out made explicit in workflow_state.json.table_style plus the decision log.",
