      "id": "stage_preconditions_and_scope",
      "theme": "workflow_contract_state",
      "invariant": "Each stage checks its entry requirements before doing the work (check_workspace_gates.py --preconditions), rollback is bounded by revision_rounds_cap and method_gate_rounds_cap with an explicit budget_exhausted_action, and project.scope (draft / working-paper / submission) fixes which gates a finished run owes without ever relaxing verification of a gate it claims to have passed. The stage -> gate map in scripts/pw.py is the single front door for both entry preconditions and exit gates, and no workspace-scoped run-time checker may be registered without being reachable from a stage.",
