      "theme": "workflow_contract_state",
      "invariant": "Substantive generative-AI assistance is recorded per stage in 00_meta/ai_use_disclosure.md and rendered into the venue-shaped declaration: an AI system is never an author, AI-generated data or result images are refused as fabrication, AI-written code and AI-screened literature cannot ship unverified, every disclosed category appears in the statement, and Stage 7 -- the stage that removes the AI accent -- cannot complete without its own disclosure row. ai_disclosure.status=pass gates orchestration.ethics_gate, replication_pack readiness, and the submission scope.",
