      "invariant": "The Stage 9 defence deck is a hard deliverable for the Chinese thesis path, so its generator is gated rather than trusted: it builds from a real workspace, extracted content reaches the slides, --duration scales the slide budget, and the mandatory closing sections (机制分析 / 研究结论与主要贡献 / 研究局限与未来展望) can never be rationed away by a long findings list. A findings list that does not fit is truncated and the truncation is reported.",
